{"id":"n64484-3-7","stage":1,"title":"구경 · 赏","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64484-3-7-1","ko":"다이어트 중이라 케이크는 못 먹지?","zh":"因为正在减肥，所以不能吃蛋糕对吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다이어트","meaning":"节食，减肥","explanation":"다이어트：节食，减肥","readings":[{"term":"다이어트","audio":"/audio/5998c9b179df5fd3b4c0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28352","senseId":"1","lemma":"다이어트","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다이어트","audio":"/audio/5998c9b179df5fd3b4c0.mp3"}},{"text":"중이라","meaning":"处在某状态的期间。","explanation":"중：处在某状态的期间。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라：连接名词判断、引用内容或相应的后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"3","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중이라","audio":"/audio/6e3240918a2791cfe204.mp3"}},{"text":"케이크는","meaning":"蛋糕","explanation":"케이크：蛋糕；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"케이크","audio":"/audio/a33b33816a170fa4bd2f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83235","senseId":"1","lemma":"케이크","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"케이크는","audio":"/audio/e96ac08c8170c7266d8a.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"먹지?","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹지","audio":"/audio/459814465f88e153b13c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5998c9b179df5fd3","term":"다이어트","zh":"节食，减肥","audio":"/audio/5998c9b179df5fd3b4c0.mp3","entryId":"28352","definition":"为了健康或美容而调节饮食种类和量。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"b558d7af71515538","term":"중","zh":"处在某状态的期间。","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3","entryId":"79404","definition":"处在某状态的期间。","pronunciation":["중"]},{"id":"a33b33816a170fa4","term":"케이크","zh":"蛋糕","audio":"/audio/a33b33816a170fa4bd2f.mp3","entryId":"83235","definition":"在面粉里放入鸡蛋、黄油、牛奶、糖等搅拌均匀后，放入烤箱烤熟并用奶油或水果等装饰的糕点。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/5a91dc17b25584a1c13d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64484-3-7-2","ko":"아, 먹지는 못해도 구경이라도 실컷 했으면 좋겠다.","zh":"啊，就算不能吃，至少也能好好看看吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아,","meaning":"喂","explanation":"아：喂","readings":[{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16247","senseId":"5","lemma":"아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}},{"text":"먹지는","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹지는","audio":"/audio/9c96036833768c549bdb.mp3"}},{"text":"못해도","meaning":"最少，起码","explanation":"못하다：最少，起码；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"못하다","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29719","senseId":"2","lemma":"못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못해도","audio":"/audio/cbca501ce16d0e2a0c10.mp3"}},{"text":"구경이라도","meaning":"赏，观看，游览","explanation":"구경：赏，观看，游览；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"구경","audio":"/audio/f7bcc82cf5b9252f8050.mp3"}],"so