73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"做，干","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，高兴，愉快","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"感情等很愉悦、很满足。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/e2483a9cd154a18eeeaf.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.83,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=64484","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"초급","day":52,"sequenceScore":2.3101,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["啊，就算不能吃，至少也能好好看看吧。","因为正在减肥，所以不能吃蛋糕对吧？","您喜欢哪种水果呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["因为正在减肥，所以不能吃蛋糕对吧？","您喜欢哪种水果呢？","啊，就算不能吃，至少也能好好看看吧。"],"answer":2}]}
